      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0009:77f38b370f1dae66",
      "arabic": "وقال عبد القدّوس بن إبراهيم: عن عطاف، عن أمه، عن أمها أثيمة جدة عطاف أنها أتت النبي ﷺ وهي صبية.",
      "english": "And Abd al-Quddus ibn Ibrahim reported from Attaf, from his mother, from her mother Athima, the grandmother of Attaf, that she came to the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, when she was a young girl.",
      "arabic_sha256": "9164e50a28f5a0a3089a89f668b4c0c9b6a489639cfae402d6064ce26a50ccef",
